<title>POLAND: Polish KPW clears Mostostal-E rights issue.</title>
<headline>Polish KPW clears Mostostal-E rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) cleared Mostostal Export one-for-50, 900,000-rights issue, Mostostal said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It did not give any other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
